{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 144,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Blessed be the LORD, my rock, who trains my hands to war, and my fingers to battle—",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华—我的磐石是应当称颂的！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華－我的磐石是應當稱頌的！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "my loving kindness, my fortress, my high tower, my deliverer, my shield, and he in whom I take refuge, who subdues my people under me.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他是我慈爱，我的山寨，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他是我慈愛，我的山寨，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "LORD, what is man, that you care for him? Or the son of man, that you think of him?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，人算什么，你竟认识他！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，人算甚麼，你竟認識他！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "Man is like a breath. His days are like a shadow that passes away.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "人好像一口气；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "人好像一口氣；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Part your heavens, LORD, and come down. Touch the mountains, and they will smoke.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，求你使天下垂，亲自降临，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，求你使天下垂，親自降臨，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "Throw out lightning, and scatter them. Send out your arrows, and rout them.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "求你发出闪电，使他们四散，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "求你發出閃電，使他們四散，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "Stretch out your hand from above, rescue me, and deliver me out of great waters, out of the hands of foreigners,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "求你从上伸手救拔我，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "求你從上伸手救拔我，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "whose mouths speak deceit, right hand is a right hand of falsehood.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们的口说谎话；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們的口說謊話；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will sing a new song to you, God. On a ten-stringed lyre, I will sing praises to you.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神啊，我要向你唱新歌，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝啊，我要向你唱新歌，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "You are he who gives salvation to kings, who rescues David, his servant, from the deadly sword.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你是那拯救君王的； 脱离害命之刀的。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你是那拯救君王的； 脫離害命之刀的。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "Rescue me, and deliver me out of the hands of foreigners, whose mouths speak deceit, whose right hand is a right hand of falsehood.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "求你救拔我，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "求你救拔我，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "Then our sons will be like well-nurtured plants, daughters like pillars carved to adorn a palace.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我们的儿子从幼年好像树栽子长大；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我們的兒子從幼年好像樹栽子長大；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "Our barns are full, filled with all kinds of provision. sheep produce thousands and ten thousands in our fields.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我们的仓盈满，能出各样的粮食；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我們的倉盈滿，能出各樣的糧食；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "Our oxen will pull heavy loads. breaking in, and no going away, and no outcry in our streets.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我们的牛驮着满驮， ， ；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我們的牛馱着滿馱， ， ；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "Happy are the people who are in such a situation. are the people whose God is the LORD.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "遇见这光景的百姓便为有福！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "遇見這光景的百姓便為有福！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}